	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"• 『ガンダムビルドダイバーズ』第7機甲師団を率いるロンメルが操る、ミリタリー仕様のグリモアカスタム機が登場！",
			"• グリモアの機能拡張をコンセプトに、各所に実践的な改修が加えられている！",
			"• 脚部のシザークロウは展開し、敵に切りかかるど派手なアクションポーズを再現可能！",
			"• 独立機として機能するミニモアが2体付属し、ランドセル内に収納できる！",
			"• ライフルは分裂し、個別の武装パーツとしても装備可能！"
		],
		"en": [
			"• \"Gundam Build Divers\" A military-spec grimoire custom machine operated by Rommel, leader of the 7th Armored Division, is now available!",
			"• Practical improvements have been made to various parts based on the concept of expanding Grimoire's functionality!",
			"• The scissor claws on the legs can be expanded to create flashy action poses such as slashing at enemies!",
			"• Comes with 2 mini mowers that function as independent machines and can be stored inside your school bag!",
			"• The rifle can be split and equipped as separate armed parts!"
		]
	},
